        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Market Targeting</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      padding: 22px;\n      background: #9171d3;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", Arial, sans-serif;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: min(100%, 496px);\n      min-height: 677px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 8px 10px 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px #e6e6e6;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 39px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 1.14;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      color: #5b4a99;\n    }\n    .chinese-title {\n      margin: 4px 0 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 37px;\n      font-family: \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: 4px;\n      color: #5b4a99;\n    }\n    .content {\n      margin-top: -1px;\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      line-height: 1.62;\n    }\n    ul {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 25px;\n    }\n    li {\n      padding-left: 2px;\n    }\n    .top > li {\n      margin: 1px 0;\n    }\n    .top > li::marker {\n      color: #555;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n    .nested {\n      margin-top: 1px;\n      margin-left: -1px;\n      padding-left: 21px;\n      border-left: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    }\n    .nested > li {\n      margin: 3px 0;\n    }\n    .nested > li::marker,\n    .detail > li::marker {\n      color: #555;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .detail {\n      margin: 2px 0 0 0;\n      padding-left: 20px;\n      border-left: 1px solid #ededed;\n    }\n    .detail > li {\n      margin: 3px 0;\n      padding-left: 1px;\n    }\n    .heading {\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    .red { color: #c82b2b; }\n    .purple {\n      color: #7660bd;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>Market Targeting</h1>\n    <div class=\"chinese-title\">目标市场</div>\n\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <ul class=\"top\">\n        <li><span class=\"heading\">What <span class=\"red\">?</span></span>\n          <ul class=\"nested\">\n            <li>明确企业应为哪一类用户服务，满足他们的哪一种需求</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n\n        <li><span class=\"heading\">How <span class=\"red\">?</span></span> 三种策略\n          <ul class=\"nested\">\n            <li><span class=\"purple\">无差别性市场策略</span>\n              <ul class=\"detail\">\n                <li>阐释：把整个市场作为自己的目标市场，只考虑共性，吸引尽可能多的消费者。可口可乐</li>\n                <li>优点：产品单一，可以保证质量，大批量生产，降低生产和销售成本</li>\n                <li>劣势：当同类竞争者也采取相同的策略，就会形成激烈竞争</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n\n            <li><span class=\"purple\">差别性市场策略</span>\n              <ul class=\"detail\">\n                <li>阐释：把整个市场细分为若干子市场，针对不同的子市场，设计不同的产品，制定不同的营销策略，满足不同的消费需求。</li>\n                <li>优势：在产品设计或宣传推销上能有的放矢，分别满足不同地区消费者的需求，可增加产品的总销售量，同时可使公司在细分小市场上占有优势</li>\n                <li>劣势：由于产品差异化、促销方式差异化，增加了管理难度，提高了生产和销售费用</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n\n            <li><span class=\"purple\">集中性市场策略</span>\n              <ul class=\"detail\">\n                <li>在细分后的市场上，选择一个或少数几个细分市场作为目标市场，实行专业化生产和销售\n                  <ul class=\"detail\">\n                    <li>优势：集中优势力量，有利于产品适销对路，降低成本，提高企业和产品的知名度</li>\n                    <li>劣势：因其目标市场范围小，品种单一，具有较大的经营风险</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n\n        <li><span class=\"heading\">How <span class=\"red\">?</span></span> 影响因素\n          <ul class=\"nested\">\n            <li>企业规模和原料的供应、产品类似性、市场类似性、产品生命周期、竞争的目标市场</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
